'''Brave Cutter''' (ユウチョキン, ''Yūchokin'', '''Brave Cutter''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]].

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (Sm): Cats' attack power increases by 10%.

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Brave Cutter|Unit Attack Up (Sm)|Power Cutter Cat|Li'l Brave Cat|jpname=ユウチョキン}}
}}

==Trivia==
*Brave Cutter's Japanese name, Yūchokin, is a portmanteau of ''yū'' (brave) and ''Sentai Chokindosu'' (Cutter Cat's Japanese name, itself a reference to [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]]' game ''[https://youtu.be/qTw6-uwHa48 Buta no Chokindosu]'').

